      "First — why willpower fails:\n\nWillpower is a depletable resource. Baumeister's research proved this decades ago. Every decision you make drains the tank.\n\nBy 2 PM, you're running on fumes. That's exactly when you reach for your phone.\n\nYou're not weak. Your strategy is wrong.",
