      { type: "a-roll", time: "1:02-1:15", script: "Audit your last week. How many hours were deep work — real, focused, uninterrupted creation? And how many were just... motion? Being busy is the laziest form of productivity. Choose depth.", visual: "Wider shot, standing, final emphasis. Holds eye contact. Slight pause before 'Choose depth.'" }
