    caption: "Busy is not the same as productive.\n\nBusy is replying to every email in real time.\nProductive is turning off notifications for 4 hours.\n\nBusy is 8 meetings a day.\nProductive is one focused block that moves the needle.\n\nBusy is motion.\nProductive is direction.\n\nI changed one thing 17 days ago: my phone doesn't exist for the first 4 hours of my day.\n\nThe results have been insane.\n\nAudit your last week. How many hours were actual deep work?\n\nBe honest.\n\n#DeepWork #Productivity #BusyVsProductive #FocusMode #75Hard #DigitalMinimalism #TimeManagement #DeepFocus #CalNewport #WorkSmarter #MorningRoutine #NoNotifications",
