      "Cal Newport nailed it:\n\n'Deep work is the ability to focus without distraction on a cognitively demanding task.'\n\nIt's a skill. And like any skill — if you don't practice it, you lose it.\n\nMost people haven't done a single hour of deep work in weeks.",
