    caption: "Day 19.\n\nIt's 2 AM. I'm tired.\n\nI've been working on something nobody knows about yet.\n\nSome days I look at it and think 'this could change everything.'\nOther days I think 'who am I kidding.'\n\nThat's the part nobody posts about.\n\nThe 2 AM version of ambition isn't motivational. It's lonely. It's quiet. It's full of doubt.\n\nBut doubt doesn't mean you're wrong.\nIt means you care enough to question it.\n\nTo everyone building something in silence right now — I see you.\n\nKeep going.\n\nDay 19. I'll be here tomorrow. That's all I've got.\n\n#75Hard #BuildInPublic #LateNights #Entrepreneurship #Doubt #KeepGoing #TheProcess #VulnerablePost #BuildingSomething #2AMThoughts #StartupLife #MentalHealth",
