      "I've been working on something nobody knows about yet.\n\nFor weeks now. Late nights. Early mornings. In between workouts and content and a full-time life.\n\nSome days I look at it and think 'this could change everything.'\n\nTonight I'm thinking 'who am I kidding.'",
